  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given equation: 8 + 4 - (7 × 5 - 6) ÷ 3 = 3.75.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 4 and 7\n\nGiven: 8 + 4 - (7 × 5 - 6) ÷ 3 = 3.75\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 8 + 7 - (__**4 × 5**__ - 6) ÷ 3 = 3.75\n\n⇒ 8 + 7 - (__20____** - 6**__) ÷ 3 = 3.75\n\n⇒ 8 + 7 - __**14**____** ÷ **____**3**__ = 3.75\n\n⇒ __**8 + 7**__ - 4.66 = 3.75\n\n⇒ __15 - 4.66__ = 3.75\n\n⇒ 10.34 ≠ 3.75\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) 8 and 5\n\nGiven: 8 + 4 - (7 × 5 - 6) ÷ 3 = 3.75\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 5 + 4 - (__**7 × 8**__ - 6) ÷ 3 = 3.75\n\n⇒ 5 + 4 - (__56____** - 6**__) ÷ 3 = 3.75\n\n⇒ 5 + 4 - __**50 ÷ 3**__ = 3.75\n\n⇒ __**5 + 4**__ - 16.66 = 3.75\n\n⇒ __9 - 16.66__ = 3.75\n\n⇒ -7.66 ≠ 3.75\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 8 and 4\n\nGiven: 8 + 4 - (7 × 5 - 6) ÷ 3 = 3.75\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 4 + 8 - (__**7 × 5**__ - 6) ÷ 3 = 3.75\n\n⇒ 4 + 8 - (__3____**5 - 6**__) ÷ 3 = 3.75\n\n⇒ 4 + 8 - __**29**____** ÷ 3**__ = 3.75\n\n⇒ __**4 + 8**__ - 9.66 = 3.75\n\n⇒ __12____ - 9.66__ = 3.75\n\n⇒ 2.34 ≠ 3.75\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 4) 3 and 4**\n\nGiven: 8 + 4 - (7 × 5 - 6) ÷ 3 = 3.75\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 8 + 3 - (__**7 × 5**__ - 6) ÷ 4 = 3.75\n\n⇒ 8 + 3 - (__**35 - 6**__) ÷ 4 = 3.75\n\n⇒ 8 + 3 - __**29 ÷ 4**__ = 3.75\n\n⇒ __**8 + 3**__ - 7.25 = 3.75\n\n⇒ __11 - 7.25__ = 3.75\n\n**⇒ 3.75 = 3.75**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
